---LINES
---SCREEN
=keyboard settings

to ."assign". a key to action:
    1) move cursor to column "key" or "key2"
    2) press .:SP... key
    3) press control key
    NOTE: pressing printable key not allowed

to ."clear assigned key:".
    1) move cursor to wanted position
    2) press .:DE... key

to change ."key labels:".
    1) move cursor to label column
    2) press .:SP... or .:DE... to start editing
    3) press .:NL... to commit changes

    NOTEs:
    - some keys cannot be reassigned
    - key labels are terminated by <space> symbol

---END
